# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bookalyze public site (apps/marketing, bookalyze.com): environment variables
#
# The site has no database or sign-in; everything here is optional, and without any of it the
# site builds and runs. Only the contact form needs settings to deliver messages.
#
# Local development: copy this file to apps/marketing/.env.local and fill in what you need.
#   cp apps/marketing/.env.example apps/marketing/.env.local
# (The site doesn't read the app's env files.)
# Production / previews: add the names in Vercel → the "bookalyze-site" project → Settings →
# Environment Variables. Never commit real values.
#
# Each variable is marked:
#   [recommended]  set it in production; something is switched off without it
#   [optional]     has a sensible default
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Contact form → support desk ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# [recommended] Messages from /contact become tickets in the app's support desk.
# Production: https://app.bookalyze.com/api/support/intake
# Locally, with the app running: http://localhost:3000/api/support/intake
SUPPORT_INTAKE_URL=
# [recommended] The SAME value as the app's SUPPORT_INTAKE_SECRET (apps/web/.env.example).
# 32+ characters: openssl rand -hex 32. Without both, or when the app can't be reached, the form
# emails the message instead (below).
SUPPORT_INTAKE_SECRET=

# ── Contact form → email (fallback) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# [recommended] A sending-only Resend key for bookalyze.com (Resend → API Keys → Create → Sending
# access). Set it for Production and Preview. Without it (and without the support desk), the form
# says it couldn't send. Locally, unset: the message is printed in the terminal instead.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# [optional] Where those emails go. Default info@bookalyze.com.
CONTACT_TO=
# [optional] Who they're from; its domain must be verified in Resend.
# Default "Bookalyze website <website@bookalyze.com>".
CONTACT_FROM=

# ── Links ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [optional] Where "Sign in" and "Start free" go. Default https://app.bookalyze.com.
# Locally: http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=
# [optional] The site's own address (canonical links, sitemap, robots). Default
# https://bookalyze.com. Locally: http://localhost:3001
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
